{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "timestamp": 1787935299, "idle_time_limit": 1.6, "env": {"SHELL": "/nix/store/l9k32vj2aczxw62134j1x0dsh569jz2l-bash-5.2p37/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "Agentic SDLC — the control layer, in nine acts"}
[0.022461, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;142m  The Agentic SDLC, as code that runs\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mSeven stages, five planes, gates that refuse, evidence as a by-product.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.023195, "m", "The closed loop"]
[0.023195, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Act 1 · The closed loop\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mThe same four commands AGENTS.md tells the agent to run. If CI and the\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2magent's loop diverge, the agent is optimising for the wrong signal.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m$ make build PY=python\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.397483, "o", "Build succeeded\r\n"]
[0.398061, "o", "  \u001b[1m$ make test PY=python\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.399736, "o", "python -m pytest -q\r\n"]
