[1.433976, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.433999, "m", "The control layer"]
[1.433999, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Act 2 · The control layer\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.434014, "o", "  \u001b[2mEight deterministic gates. No model is consulted in any of them: the decision\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mto allow or block is arithmetic over policy that lives in policy/ as YAML —\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.434081, "o", "  \u001b[2mthe same tables governance signed off.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.434108, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1m$ make gates PY=python\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.478544, "o", "[PASS] FIN-02 money\r\n"]
[1.646945, "o", "[PASS] DP-11 pii\r\n"]
[1.718639, "o", "[PASS] SEC-API-01 endpoints\r\n"]
[1.839074, "o", "[PASS] FRZ-01 frozen_paths\r\n"]
[1.88247, "o", "  (GitHub CODEOWNERS validator unavailable; checked the file only)\r\n"]
[1.884684, "o", "[PASS] SOD-01 codeowners\r\n"]
[2.34685, "o", "[PASS] CHG-04 artifact_header\r\n"]
[2.485079, "o", "[PASS] HUM-14 autonomy\r\n"]
[2.597035, "o", "[PASS] TRC-01 plan_conformance\r\n"]
[2.660172, "o", "bundled 11 gate result(s) covering 10 control(s)\r\n"]
[2.671048, "o", "All gates passed\r\n"]
[2.671683, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.671728, "m", "The gates refuse"]
[2.671728, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Act 3 · The gates refuse\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.671767, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mThis is the act that matters. Each gate has the thing it protects deliberately\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mbroken, and must go red. A gate verified only by passing is indistinguishable\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.671814, "o", "  \u001b[2mfrom a gate that cannot fail.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[2.671855, "o", "  \u001b[1m$ make negative PY=python\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[2.673529, "o", "bash scripts/demo/negative/run_all.sh\r\n"]
[2.684784, "o", "\r\nNegative tests — each gate must refuse:\r\n\r\n"]
[2.734287, "o", "  refused         FIN-02  float on a monetary field\r\n"]
[2.950797, "o", "  refused         DP-11   personal data in an error message\r\n"]
[3.137198, "o", "  refused         DP-11   logging outside audit.safe_log()\r\n"]
[3.200293, "o", "  refused         SEC-API-01  unauthenticated, unaudited POST\r\n"]
[3.33403, "o", "  refused         FRZ-01  edit to a frozen path\r\n"]
[3.389111, "o", "  refused         SOD-01  CODEOWNERS rule guarding a missing path\r\n"]
[3.463189, "o", "  refused         SOD-01  control layer with no named owner\r\n"]
[3.932758, "o", "  refused         CHG-04  artifact with no header\r\n"]
[4.39597, "o", "  refused         CHG-04  raw model name instead of a route\r\n"]
[4.567511, "o", "  refused         HUM-14  R3 change claiming A3 autonomy\r\n"]
[4.744605, "o", "  refused         HUM-14  material change declared R1\r\n"]
[4.899893, "o", "  refused         TRC-01  code changed with no plan claiming it\r\n"]
[4.91249, "o", "\r\n  12 refused, 0 did not.\r\n\r\n"]
[4.917416, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.917468, "m", "The supervisory question"]
[4.917468, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Act 4 · The supervisory question\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[4.917525, "o", "  \u001b[2mWhich production changes touched control SEC-API-01, which were agent-authored,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mat what autonomy tier, and who approved each one?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mSeconds, from the repository. The playbook calls answering this in minutes\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mrather than a week the highest-value output of the whole programme.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m$ python scripts/query_evidence.py --control SEC-API-01\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[5.061594, "o", "\r\n  DEMO DATA — generated by this repository's own pipeline against a synthetic service. Not an audit record of any institution.\r\n\r\n  Query: SEC-API-01\r\n\r\n  CHG-2026-014880  R3/A2  human-authored\r\n      originator   olaf@freundcloud.com\r\n      agent        svc-agent-platform  route gateway/tier-frontier\r\n      chain        intent -> plan -> spec\r\n      controls     CHG-04, TRC-01, HUM-14, TPR-05, SEC-API-01, DP-11, FIN-02, FRZ-01, SOD-01\r\n      gates        0/1 passed\r\n      approvers    olaf@freundcloud.com\r\n\r\n  CHG-2026-014882  R3/A2  human-authored\r\n"]
[5.061685, "o", "      originator   j.ortiz@example.com\r\n      agent        svc-agent-platform  route gateway/tier-balanced\r\n      chain        intent -> plan -> spec\r\n      controls     SEC-API-01, CHG-04, DP-11\r\n      gates        0/1 passed\r\n      approvers    olaf@freundcloud.com\r\n\r\n  2 change(s). Answered from the repository, no reconstruction.\r\n\r\n"]
[5.070619, "m", "Stage 6 \u2014 detection with no model in it"]
[5.070619, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Act 5 · Stage 6 — detection with no model in it\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[5.070714, "o", "  \u001b[2mWestern Electric rules over a 30-day rolling baseline, unit-tested including\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mthe drift case no simple threshold catches. A model that decides whether\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2msomething is anomalous is a control you cannot evidence.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m$ python -m pytest scripts/tests/test_detect_anomaly.py -q\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
