[5.642358, "o", "\r\n  Evals: 24/24 = 100% (mode=static, threshold=90%)\r\n\r\n"]
[5.651295, "o", "[PASS] TPR-05 evals\r\n"]
[5.658946, "m", "The Substitution Test"]
[5.658946, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Act 7 · The Substitution Test\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.659022, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mAppendix C, scored by inspecting the repository rather than by self-assessment.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mNothing scores a mark for a document that merely claims a property.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[5.659043, "o", "  \u001b[1m$ make substitution PY=python\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[5.660786, "o", "python scripts/substitution_test.py\r\n"]
[5.695668, "o", "  PASS   1. Context in AGENTS.md, not a vendor filename\r\n        AGENTS.md is the source of truth; the Copilot file is a pointer\r\n"]
[5.696196, "o", "  PASS   2. Procedures as Agent Skills\r\n        5 skills, each with a named policy owner\r\n"]
[5.715325, "o", "  PASS   3. Tools via MCP on a platform allowlist\r\n        4 servers allowlisted, deny by default\r\n"]
[6.019121, "o", "  PASS   4. All model calls traverse your gateway\r\n        one gateway; no direct provider endpoint anywhere in the tree\r\n"]
[6.325384, "o", "  PASS   5. Model choices are routes, not model names\r\n        4 routes, zero raw model names\r\n"]
[6.330815, "o", "  PASS   6. Every must-hold control has a deterministic gate\r\n        9 control objectives, each with a deterministic gate\r\n"]
[6.334181, "o", "  PASS   7. Telemetry in OTel, normalised at your collector\r\n        OTLP to a collector that normalises the GenAI attributes\r\n"]
[6.334581, "o", "  PASS   8. Approval gates in your CI and VCS\r\n        9 workflows, CODEOWNERS, environment approval gate"]
[6.334587, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.345316, "o", "  PASS   9. Agent identity distinct from human identity\r\n        agent_identity and originator both required and validated separately\r\n"]
[6.345664, "o", "  PASS  10. Eval suite can qualify a new model in a day\r\n        24 eval cases with a non-interactive runner\r\n"]
[6.598671, "o", "  PASS  11. Artifact chain in your repository\r\n        28 artifacts, 8 complete chain(s), all headers valid\r\n"]
[6.598771, "o", "  PASS  12. Signed evidence trail without asking a vendor\r\n        signed in-toto provenance from your own CI, queryable locally\r\n\r\n  Substitution Test: 12/12 — PORTABLE — you can change your mind, which is the only durable position.\r\n\r\n"]
[6.602438, "o", "[PASS] TPR-05 substitution_test\r\n"]
[6.611597, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.611614, "m", "Change the agent vendor"]
[6.611614, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Act 8 · Change the agent vendor\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[6.611697, "o", "  \u001b[2mThe question third-party risk asks first. Every vendor answers 'nothing'.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mHere it is executed: each runtime is selected in turn and the repository\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mre-scores itself. A score that moves is a portability debt, not a refactor.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m$ make swap PY=python\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[6.613551, "o", "bash scripts/demo/swap/run_all.sh\r\n"]
[6.732121, "o", "\r\n  Scoring the repository under each agent runtime:\r\n\r\n  runtime    gates     evals    subst    cost vs HEAD\r\n  ---------  --------  -------  -------  ------------\r\n"]
[9.104657, "o", "  copilot    8/8       24/24    12/12    0+ 0-\r\n"]
[11.498493, "o", "  claude     8/8       24/24    12/12    1+ 1-\r\n"]
[13.889963, "o", "  gemini     8/8       24/24    12/12    1+ 1-\r\n"]
[16.293132, "o", "  codex      8/8       24/24    12/12    1+ 1-\r\n\r\n  Identical under every runtime, because none of it belongs to a vendor:\r\n"]
[16.301505, "o", "     5 skills          24 eval cases       4 policy tables\r\n"]
[16.309519, "o", "     8 gates           28 artifacts        9 control objectives\r\n"]
[16.309577, "o", "\r\n  Every runtime scores identically. The swap is one line in .agent/runtimes.yaml.\r\n\r\n"]
[16.390418, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.390457, "o", "\u001b[38;5;142m\u001b[1m  Every act passed.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[16.391829, "o", "  What was demonstrated, and what each part costs to move:\r\n\r\n    the gates        arithmetic over YAML you wrote          yours\r\n    the skills       portable markdown, named policy owner   yours\r\n    the chain        commits in your repository              yours\r\n    the evidence     emitted as controls execute             yours\r\n    the agent        one line in .agent/runtimes.yaml        replaceable\r\n\r\n  The agent drafted, proposed and reviewed. It decided nothing.\r\n\r\n"]
